flowchart LR
    POS[Frontend Kasir / Admin / Barista] --> API[Fastify API v1]
    API --> AUTH[JWT + RBAC + outlet scope]
    AUTH --> SVC[Application Services]
    SVC --> DB[(PostgreSQL schema gcims)]
    SVC --> OUTBOX[Transactional outbox]
    OUTBOX -. worker belum dibuat .-> WORKER[Background publisher]
    SVC -. provider belum dipilih .-> PAY[Payment Gateway / QRIS]
    DB --> KDS[KDS tickets + events]
